      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَنَّمْتُهُ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَغْنِيمٌ</span>, <i>I gave him spoil,</i> or <i>a
free and disinterested gift;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَفَّلْتُهُ</span>: (S:) or
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَنَّمَهُ كَذَا</span>, inf. n. as above, <i>he gave him such a
thing as spoil,</i> or <i>as a free and disinterested gift;</i>
syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَفَّلَهُ إِيَّاهُ</span>. (K.)

